# One decision about line endings, made here, so a Windows clone and a Mac clone
# never produce a whole-file diff for a change nobody actually made. text=auto lets
# git detect binary files on its own; eol=lf pins the working tree as well, which
# matters because data/nifty_yearly_2005_2025.csv is verified by sha256 and its
# bytes have to be identical on every machine.
* text=auto eol=lf
